  unitName: Horseman Sodis
  unitId: 50383
  unitNumber: 455
  description: Leader of the 12 Guardians of the Gods, protectors of the land of
    the gods. As broad-minded as he was strong, his thoughtfulness for his comrades
    led to him being greatly admired by many. Though his personality seemed frank
    to those around him, many were overwhelmed by the solemn air about him. He would
    try to reassure nervous allies with a joke here and there, but it seems this
    only made them more anxious. There's a rumor that Lunaris would often laugh at
    this as she found it highly amusing.
  summonDesc: Sodis, leader of the <br>12 Guardians at your service.<br>Let us walk
    a just path!
  fusionDesc: Ha ha ha!<br>My training is progressing well!<br>I look forward to
    more!
